[{ "action": "append", "id": "event-modals", "value" : "<div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"modal-98a1984b-d910-4d10-b9c6-65e0a9a33161\" class=\"modal\"><div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><a data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"close\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span></a><p class=\"text-muted\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-road\"></span> Research Papers</p><strong>Thu 15 Oct 2026 11:00 - 11:15 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/ase-2026/ase-2026-venue1-forum-2\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Forum 2</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/ase-2026/ase-2026-research-track#program\" class=\"navigate\">Security and Other Non-Functional Properties: Security and Privacy 6</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/teganbrennan1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Tegan Brennan</a></small></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><div class=\"bg-primary event-title\"><h4><span data-event-star=\"98a1984b-d910-4d10-b9c6-65e0a9a33161\" title=\"Add event to your program\"><span class=\"text-disabled glyphicon glyphicon-star-empty\"></span></span><strong>Zero-Knowledge VMs: Security and Usability in Practice</strong></h4></div><div class=\"bg-info event-description\"><p>Zero-knowledge Virtual Machines (zkVMs) are emerging critical infrastructure for blockchain Layer 2 scaling solutions, enabling execution of arbitrary programs while generating succinct proofs of correct computation. Despite hundreds of millions of investment, the rapidly evolving zkVM ecosystem lacks comprehensive empirical analysis of its security and usability challenges. We present the first systematic study of zkVM vulnerability and usability issues, analyzing production zkVMs through three perspectives covering 314 security vulnerabilities (professional audits), 11,854 commits (developer practices), and 1,150 user issues (user experiences). We identify prevalent, severe, and non-traditional vulnerability categories and their root causes, reveal high-value attack surfaces that consistently emerge across zkVMs, and identify major usability issues that users struggle with. Comparing our findings against existing research reveals four gaps representing research and tool development opportunities for the testing and analysis of zkVMs.</p>\n<p></p><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/3832783.3837500\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"publication-link navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-link\"></span> DOI</a><p></p><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/jinanjiang1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Jinan Jiang<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Hong Kong Polytechnic University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Hong Kong</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/jinzhaochu1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Jinzhao Chu<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Hong Kong Polytechnic University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Hong Kong</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/pengyuxue3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Pengyu Xue<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Hong Kong Polytechnic University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Hong Kong</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/xinghaopeng1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Xinghao Peng<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Hong Kong Polytechnic University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Hong Kong</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/haoranqin\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Haoran Qin<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Hong Kong Polytechnic University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Hong Kong</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/xiapuluo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left